OL,3,AArgentina to sanction oil firms as
OL,4,Atensions heighten in Falklands dispute
OL,5,Awith UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FArgentina's President, Javier Milei,
OL,8,Fhas heightened tensions with the UK
OL,9,Fover the Falklands, warning he will
OL,10,Fimpose economic sanctions on firms
OL,11,Fwhich exploit oil close to the British
OL,12,Foverseas territory.
OL,14,FIn a national address, Milei said the
OL,15,F"winds of change" favoured Argentina's
OL,16,Fclaim to the islands, emboldened by
OL,17,Fsigns the US might reconsider its
OL,18,Fstance of neutrality on the issue.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
