OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1788497737
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AArgentina to sanction oil firms as
OL,4,Atensions heighten in Falklands dispute
OL,5,Awith UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FMilei said the Sea Lion oilfield, where
OL,8,Fa British and an Israeli firm are due
OL,9,Fto begin exploration work, was a "clear
OL,10,Fand present danger".
OL,12,FMore than 40 years after the war over
OL,13,Fthe territory, sovereignty of the
OL,14,Farchipelago in the south-west Atlantic
OL,15,FOcean remains hotly disputed between
OL,16,FBritain and Argentina.
